      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly planogram refresh or green campaign
Frequency: Quarterly; campaign activations
Volume: 200 stores; ~2,000–3,000 green products
Owner: Merchandising Manager
Participants: Merchandising Mgr, Store Ops, Marketing, Sustainability Coordinator
Source: workflow W2722 — Green Product Merchandising &amp; In-Store Display</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2722_LaneSet4">
