Frequency: Quarterly; campaign-driven
Volume: 600K loyalty + 5K trade customers
Owner: Content Marketing Manager
Participants: Content Marketing Mgr, Sustainability Coordinator, Category Manager
Source: workflow W2723 — Green Product Customer Education Content Development</bpmn:documentation>
