      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2723_Task5" name="Content Marketing Manager develops content: how-to guides (energy-efficient…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Content Marketing Manager develops content: how-to guides (energy-efficient renovation, water-saving upgrade), sustainability comparisons, BERDE/LEED case studies
Responsible (R): Content Marketing Manager / Sustainability Coordinator
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1–2 weeks/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2723_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2723_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2723_Task6" name="Distributes across channels: app/website (green building hub), social media…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Distributes across channels: app/website (green building hub), social media, in-store kiosk, trade newsletter, YouTube (DIY green videos), workshops
Responsible (R): Content Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Per content calendar</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2723_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2723_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2723_Task7" name="Marketing measures: engagement (views, shares), conversion (reader → purchase)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Marketing measures: engagement (views, shares), conversion (reader → purchase), trade feedback, workshop attendance; adjusts strategy based on data
Responsible (R): Marketing
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2723_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
