      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer requests documentation for certified project
Frequency: Ad-hoc; 10–20 requests/month
Volume: ~10–20/month
Owner: Trade Sales Representative
Participants: Trade Sales Rep, Sustainability Coordinator, Category Manager, Quality
Source: workflow W2724 — BERDE/LEED Project Material Documentation Support</bpmn:documentation>
